<div class="chat-log">
<div class="msg them">❤️</div>
<div class="msg them">Thank you for being here. Even in someone else's skin.</div>
<div class="msg them">Priya told me you look "relaxed." Careful. Relaxed isn't Kavya's default. Kavya's default is "irritated genius." Practice irritated.</div>
<div class="msg me">Working on my irritated face. It's hard because I'm happy.</div>
<div class="msg them">🥺</div>
<div class="msg them">Tonight. After swap-back. I'll be thinking about today for weeks.</div>
</div>

