:: Day3Complete [nobr]
<div class="title-screen">
<div class="th">पहला बदलाव पूरा</div>
<div class="te">End of Day 3</div>

<p class="lede">Arjun is back in Katraj, in his own body, in a bed that suddenly feels enormous, replaying twelve hours in someone else's skin. Kavya is in Room 304, grieving a keyboard, her own breasts strapped back into their usual argument with gravity.</p>

<p class="lede">The first cross-gender swap is complete. Nobody's cover held perfectly   Pooja clocked a texting anomaly, Aai heard something under the voice, Krishnan is asking about a research symposium, Dr. Sharma noticed "Kavya" being kind. But nobody knows. Not yet.</p>

<div class="thought arjun">ARJUN   Coding <<= $stats.a_coding>> · Fem-comfort <<= $stats.a_femComfort>> · Rel Meera <<= $stats.rel_arjun_meera>> · Rel Kavya <<= $stats.rel_arjun_kavya>> · Drawn to female frame <<= $stats.a_sexF>></div>
<div class="thought kavya">KAVYA   Coding <<= $stats.k_coding>> · Masc-comfort <<= $stats.k_mascComfort>> · Rel Arjun <<= $stats.rel_kavya_arjun>> · Drawn to male frame <<= $stats.k_sexM>> · Krishnan symposium: <<= setup.has("research_symposium_invited") ? "invited" : "no"></div>

<p class="lede">Swaps: <<= $swapCount>> · barrier <<= $barrierIntegrity>>%. Discoveries logged: <<= ($discoveries.arjun.length + $discoveries.kavya.length)>>. The Colonel still visits Sunday.</p>

<div class="version-note">
<p class="lede"><b>This is the end of the version 0.3 content.</b></p>
<p class="lede">Thank you for playing VIDHI. If you'd like to see more of this story   or just support the work   you can back the project on Patreon:</p>
